{"root":"kemudian","ipa":"/kəmudian/","core":"表示时间上的先后顺序，意为“然后”、“接着”、“后来”。","pos":["虚词"],"scenes":["高频","工作","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/kəmudian/","zh":"然后，接着，后来","phrases":[{"t":"kemudian hari","zh":"日后，将来"},{"t":"dan kemudian","zh":"以及后来"},{"t":"tak lama kemudian","zh":"不久之后"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia makan siang, kemudian pergi ke kantor.","zh":"他吃了午饭，然后去了办公室。"},{"t":"Kemudian, masalah itu berhasil diselesaikan.","zh":"后来，那个问题被成功解决了。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"kemudian","ipa":"/kəmudian/","zh":"然后，接着","phrase":{"t":"kemudian daripada itu","zh":"在此之后"},"example":{"t":"Tunggu sebentar, kemudian kita berangkat.","zh":"等一会儿，然后我们出发。"}},{"w":"kemudiannya","ipa":"/kəmudianɲa/","zh":"其后，随后","phrase":{"t":"pada kemudiannya","zh":"在随后的时间里"},"example":{"t":"Dia pindah ke Jakarta dan kemudiannya bekerja di sana.","zh":"他搬到了雅加达，随后在那里工作。"}}],"derSlugs":["kemudian","kemudiannya"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-25T09:30:41.860Z","src":"base"}